<p>Note: The company also said it plans to build a 90,000 square foot steel blanking facility in Georgia.</p>
<p>The company said it will invest $1.8 million in the facility, and will begin construction in late 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the facility will employ about 75 people by the end of fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>The company said the new facility will primarily serve the automotive industry.</p>
